        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>theater</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of theater" onclick="speakGloss(event,'theater')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(THEE-uh-ter)</span>: A large region where part of a war is fought.</div>
